{
 "meta": {
  "name": "Faisal Al-Juhaimy studio · design tokens",
  "version": "V900 (SQDS palette)",
  "note": "Single source of truth for the page shell until the SQDS library lands: the site build writes every token below as a CSS custom property on :root, exposes the motion, fx and signals groups to scripts as window.TOKENS, and publishes this file as tokens.json. sqds/tokens.css (the SQDS library, owned by its team) is inlined first; the colour roles below point at its variables with this file's values as fallbacks. The overlay veil stays darker than SQDS's for text over video. The page is dark-only. Gold is reserved for three executive signals (signals.gold); never use it for decoration."
 },
